reate a playstyle that's your own. With so much to find, no two playthroughs are exactly the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158690/extras/c1a4f009bc95e3636815a2f01614644f.poster.avif?t=1752866512\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158690/extras/c1a4f009bc95e3636815a2f01614644f.webm?t=1752866512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158690/extras/c1a4f009bc95e3636815a2f01614644f.mp4?t=1752866512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROGRESSION:</strong> You're not in this fight alone. Rescue stranded colonists to rebuild and expand the outpost. Each person you rescue brings something new. Sell loot and make upgrades. As you grow stronger, so does your home base.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>A Modern Metroidvania-like</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Rift Saga takes the best elements of the Metroidvania genre \u2014 ability-based progression, non-linear exploration, and rewarding secrets \u2014 while minimizing the repetitive backtracking that can slow down the pace. You'll be rewarded for backtracking and exploring areas you've already been more deeply, but not required to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u> a vast, interconnected planet with secrets around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight</strong></u> a variety of enemies and bosses in real-time platforming combat using weapons and items on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> items and skill chips to help you in tight situations. No need to stop the action or navigate a menu to use one, your inventory is always right at your fingertips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize</strong></u> your playstyle using over 140 skill chips. Boost your stats, gain new abilities, or change entire weapons by equipping chips in the puzzle-based skill grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Upgrade</strong></u> your arsenal. You'll find new equipment and weapons to reach new areas, increase the selection at your local items shop, and even rescue colonists to gain new benefits at the outpost.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Vela LLC"],"dlc":[3658500],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158690/307c4f40240f8a78d16754047b12420637b99189/header.jpg?t=1752866512","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Studio Vela LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2158690/746612/2c0d748fcd03e13a98788397b49fd7fa4dac5b4e/1751083451/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745426258","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2158690/746612/2c0d748fcd03e13a98788397b49fd7fa4dac5b4e/1751083451/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745426258","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2158690/746612/2c0d748fcd03e13a98788397b49fd7fa4dac5b4e/1751083451/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745426258","id":257049822,"name":"Gameplay Trailer | Star Rift Saga","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257049822/6c09f54049cb5b0a641ca94daa047dfcc7166c16/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745426258"}],"name":"Star Rift Saga","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option",